1
00:00:09,844 --> 00:00:13,594
这是一位有很多问题的 小女孩的故事
This is the story of a girl who had a lot of problems.

2
00:00:37,261 --> 00:00:37,886
Ruby!
Ruby!

3
00:00:47,553 --> 00:00:50,803
你根本就不应该出生
You should have never been born.

4
00:01:48,594 --> 00:01:49,511
Ruby!
Ruby!

5
00:01:56,094 --> 00:01:57,511
Ruby!
Ruby!

6
00:02:03,969 --> 00:02:04,594
Ruby!!
Ruby!!

7
00:04:38,469 --> 00:04:40,428
如果你也能帮我就好了...
Now if only you could help me...

8
00:04:44,636 --> 00:04:45,678
我可以试试
I could try.

9
00:04:52,844 --> 00:04:54,094
你怎么突然大叫
Why are you yelling?

10
00:04:55,136 --> 00:04:56,886
因为你-
B- B- B- Because you-

11
00:04:58,594 --> 00:04:59,969
你也想吃吗
Did you want to share?

12
00:05:01,719 --> 00:05:03,136
这样也公平
I guess it's only fair.

13
00:05:03,219 --> 00:05:05,428
不是 没关系的
No, that's- that's alright

14
00:05:08,969 --> 00:05:12,636
只是我从来没跟一只 老鼠对话过
I've just never really spoken to a- a mouse before

15
00:05:15,011 --> 00:05:19,511
嗯 我也从来没跟一只... 你对话过
Well, I guess I've never spoken to a... you before

16
00:05:20,428 --> 00:05:21,636
你到底是什么
What are you?

17
00:05:22,219 --> 00:05:23,969
哦 这 我是个人类
Oh, um, I'm a human.

18
00:05:25,219 --> 00:05:27,594
是个女孩子? 猎人?
A girl? A Huntress?

19
00:05:28,844 --> 00:05:30,386
同时是好多东西啊
That's a lot of things.

20
00:05:31,803 --> 00:05:35,386
我是 我叫Ruby Rose
I'm, I'm Ruby Rose.

21
00:05:36,594 --> 00:05:40,219
而你的使命是要去Ruby Rose?
And to Ruby Rose is your purpose?

22
00:05:40,469 --> 00:05:43,261
不不 那是我的名字
No, no, that's my name.

23
00:05:44,469 --> 00:05:45,261
你有名字吗
Do you have a name?

24
00:05:45,719 --> 00:05:48,053
我现在还小 所以还没有
I'm still young, so not yet

25
00:05:49,636 --> 00:05:53,428
那么我暂时叫你「小小」
How a about I call you Little for now

26
00:05:54,678 --> 00:05:55,428
可以吗
is that alright?

27
00:05:57,469 --> 00:05:59,553
我要怎么去 小小?
How does one, Little?

28
00:06:06,261 --> 00:06:07,011
怎么了吗?
What's wrong?

29
00:06:10,803 --> 00:06:12,886
你有见过其他人吗?
Have you seen other people?

30
00:06:13,636 --> 00:06:15,178
像我一样的人类
Humans, like me

31
00:06:15,219 --> 00:06:17,178
和你一模一样?
Exactly like you?

32
00:06:17,678 --> 00:06:20,428
不是 不完全跟我一样
No, not exactly like me.

33
00:06:21,386 --> 00:06:23,261
我们大体上相似 但各不相同
We are similar, but different.

34
00:06:24,928 --> 00:06:26,886
多讲一点 我肯能搞懂
I'm sure it would make sense eventually.

35
00:06:29,636 --> 00:06:32,553
有一个人有金色的长发
One would have long, blonde hair.

36
00:06:34,219 --> 00:06:39,219
还有一个 长着猫耳
The other has, well uhh cat ears.

37
00:06:42,261 --> 00:06:45,219
抱歉 我该想到的 毕竟卡通里都这么设定
Sorry I- I should've known, I've seen plently of cartoons.

38
00:06:48,011 --> 00:06:53,136
我也没见过什么像你 或者不像你的人
Well, I've never seen anyone who does, or doesn't look like you.

39
00:06:53,678 --> 00:06:56,469
但是 村子里也许有谁会见过
But, maybe someone in my village has.

40
00:06:56,761 --> 00:06:58,136
他们天天到处采集
They're always out foraging.

41
00:06:58,928 --> 00:07:01,053
因为要找食物什么的
You know, since we need food and stuff

42
00:07:03,969 --> 00:07:09,011
话说回来 这东西可以多整几个吗
speaking of which, a few more of these wouldn't hurt

43
00:07:12,011 --> 00:07:13,719
你肯定就在这附近吗?
You really think it's around here somewhere?

44
00:07:14,344 --> 00:07:17,469
我现在可不觉得有什么事是肯定的
I wouldn't exactly say I'm certain about anything at the moment.

45
00:07:18,344 --> 00:07:21,469
跃影飞绫是在你和Ruby之后掉下去的 然后才是我
Gambol Shroud fell after you and Ruby, but before I did.

46
00:07:22,136 --> 00:07:27,386
不过我们还是碰上了 所以... 这是什么地方
And we found each other, so... What is this place?

47
00:07:27,803 --> 00:07:31,761
我也不知道 我的猜测似乎都不靠谱
Idon't know. None of my guesses really makes sense.

48
00:07:33,636 --> 00:07:33,928
Blake
Blake

49
00:07:36,969 --> 00:07:38,344
你没事真是太好了
I'm really glad you're okay.

50
00:07:40,303 --> 00:07:41,594
你也是
I'm really glad you're too.

51
00:07:43,928 --> 00:07:46,803
如果我们都没事 那么Yang和Ruby可能也没事
And if we are, then that means Yang and Ruby might be.

52
00:07:52,219 --> 00:07:53,761
Weiss 你能不能..
Weiss, can you-

53
00:07:54,886 --> 00:07:57,136
我们掉下去之后发生什么事了
what happened after we fell?

54
00:08:00,969 --> 00:08:03,511
现在还是先找到其他人再说吧
We should focus on finding everyone else first.

55
00:08:05,511 --> 00:08:06,886
我发现了点东西
I think I see something!

56
00:08:12,886 --> 00:08:14,886
也算是不幸中的万幸?
I... guess it could've been worse.

57
00:08:16,053 --> 00:08:18,594
好消息 我尘晶也不够用了
Well good news, I'm low on Dust.

58
00:08:18,803 --> 00:08:20,719
这可不是让你顺着抖坏消息的台阶啊
That wasn't an invitation, Weiss

59
00:08:21,094 --> 00:08:21,511
对不起啦
Sorry.

60
00:08:53,553 --> 00:08:55,803
陷阱捉到东西了
The trap has been sprung!

61
00:08:57,011 --> 00:08:59,511
正义制裁了我们的猎物
Justice befalls our prey!

62
00:08:59,928 --> 00:09:01,219
牠们是在说话吗?
Are they talking?

63
00:09:01,344 --> 00:09:03,261
现在我最担心的不是这个啊
Not what I'm worried about right now!

64
00:09:07,344 --> 00:09:09,219
你是在我身上流口水吗?
Are you drooling on me?

65
00:09:13,594 --> 00:09:18,261
在今天 我们不再是猎物 而是猎人!
And on this day, we are not the prey, but the hunter!

66
00:09:21,844 --> 00:09:24,178
呃 这是咋了?
Uh... What's going on?

67
00:09:25,553 --> 00:09:28,553
哎呀 那不是你的猫猫朋友吗
Oh hey... that's your cat friend

68
00:09:29,761 --> 00:09:30,844
咿呀啊啊!
Eeeek!

69
00:09:33,136 --> 00:09:34,761
新的敌入已经出现!
A new adversary approaches!

70
00:09:35,053 --> 00:09:36,969
我们必须救出我们的族人!
We must liberate our kin!

71
00:09:40,136 --> 00:09:42,761
我当时都不知道该咋办 因为她看起来很伤心
I didn't know what to do because she looked sad,

72
00:09:43,219 --> 00:09:45,886
不过我们唠了一会儿 然后她看着就没那么伤心了
But then we talked, and she seemed less sad.

73
00:09:46,428 --> 00:09:51,011
然后然后 她只靠自己就把芝士从地里拔出来了!
Then, she pulled the cheese OUT OF THE GROUND all on her own!

74
00:09:53,011 --> 00:09:53,928
哇哦!
Woah!

75
00:09:57,011 --> 00:09:58,886
我们诚心向您表示歉意
You have our sincerest apologies.

76
00:09:59,136 --> 00:10:02,511
但请您理解 我们的族群对猫总是带有些怀疑的
Please understand that our kind is a bit skeptical of cats.

77
00:10:03,303 --> 00:10:03,844
对蛇也是
And snakes.

78
00:10:05,553 --> 00:10:06,136
然后对猫也是
And cats.

79
00:10:06,511 --> 00:10:07,261
我们能理解
We understand.

80
00:10:08,094 --> 00:10:09,719
如果你不介意我们询问一下
we could ask.

81
00:10:10,511 --> 00:10:12,303
你们有没有看见过其他跟我们很像的人?
lave you seen anyone else that looks like us

82
00:10:13,011 --> 00:10:14,469
长金发
Long, blonde hair,

83
00:10:14,511 --> 00:10:16,511
看着有点吓人但是其实并不可怕
Looks kinda scary but isn't.

84
00:10:16,761 --> 00:10:18,303
如果她想的话也可以挺吓人的
But could be if she wanted to.

85
00:10:25,136 --> 00:10:26,011
还是谢谢了
Thanks anyway.

86
00:10:27,469 --> 00:10:29,303
在这些事发生前
Before all of... this.

87
00:10:29,594 --> 00:10:31,469
我原本是想去那边的山崖
I was trying to go to that cliff over there.

88
00:10:32,344 --> 00:10:35,053
我觉得去高一些的地方 搞清楚自己的处境会比较好
I figured going to higher ground and getting my bearings would be good.

89
00:10:35,553 --> 00:10:37,261
这是现在最好的选择了
Sounds like the best option for now

90
00:10:37,469 --> 00:10:39,928
如果你们想去山崖 我可以帮你们呀!
you want to go to the cliff, I could help with tha

91
00:10:40,011 --> 00:10:40,219
啊啊啊!
Ahh!

92
00:10:40,803 --> 00:10:43,344
我暂时还没有什么要做的事
I don't really have anything to do yet.

93
00:10:44,719 --> 00:10:45,053
暂时?
Yet?

94
00:10:45,928 --> 00:10:47,803
我可以成为你们可靠的导游
I can be your trusty guide

95
00:10:55,719 --> 00:10:58,761
或者 我们也可以自己找到方向
Or.. I guess we can figure it out ourselves.

96
00:10:59,053 --> 00:11:00,553
至少他们带我们到了这条路上
At least they got us to this path.

97
00:11:01,178 --> 00:11:02,094
我们得快点了
We need to hurry,

98
00:11:02,386 --> 00:11:05,219
Yang是最先下来的 我们到现在都还没找到她
Yang's been down here the longest and we still haven't found her.

99
00:11:07,011 --> 00:11:13,719
Weiss 我一直在想 如果你都掉下来了… 那这里是不是还有其他人?
Weiss, I was wondering, if you fell... Are there others down here too?

100
00:11:15,303 --> 00:11:16,136
到底发生了什么?
What happened?

101
00:11:20,178 --> 00:11:22,261
我不知道有没有其他人掉下来
I don't know if anyone else fell, no.

102
00:11:23,053 --> 00:11:26,136
我觉得我们应该先找到Yang 如果她真的在这儿的话
I think we should find Yang, if she's even down here.

103
00:11:26,803 --> 00:11:28,136
然后我们可以再讨论那时发生的事情
Then we can go over everything.

104
00:11:29,344 --> 00:11:29,761
我只是…
I just...

105
00:11:38,261 --> 00:11:47,636
寻觅 寻找 清理 追踪
Seeking, searching, scouring, stalking...

106
00:11:48,844 --> 00:11:53,511
寻找 清理 追踪
Searching, scouring, stalking...

107
00:11:54,719 --> 00:11:55,928
啊 咿呀啊!
Ah... eek!

108
00:11:57,553 --> 00:12:00,553
感应 聆听
Detecting, listening...

109
00:12:12,761 --> 00:12:14,969
危险! 死亡!
Danger! Death!

110
00:12:16,178 --> 00:12:18,594
撕咬!撕破!撕毁!
Bite! Rip! Tear!

111
00:12:21,928 --> 00:12:24,261
我说了 我跟你还没完呢!
I said I wasn't done with you yet!

112
00:12:34,011 --> 00:12:34,886
后退…
Recede...

113
00:12:35,553 --> 00:12:36,219
撤退…
Retreat...

114
00:12:37,553 --> 00:12:38,386
等待…
Wait...

115
00:12:39,553 --> 00:12:40,719
返回…
Return...

116
00:12:48,553 --> 00:12:49,511
Yang! 我…
Yang! I...

117
00:12:49,553 --> 00:12:49,803
可恶!
Damn it!

118
00:12:52,178 --> 00:12:53,636
你不应该在这里的
You weren't supposed to be here.

119
00:12:56,219 --> 00:13:00,011
如果你觉得我们不会为你而来 那你一定忘了是谁把我带大的
If you thought we wouldn't come for you then you must have forgotten who raised me.

120
00:13:01,428 --> 00:13:03,636
你的手臂怎么了?
What happened to your arm?

121
00:13:04,761 --> 00:13:06,886
就算我说了你们也未必会信
I don't think you'd believe me if I told you.

122
00:13:07,178 --> 00:13:07,803
为啥呀?
Why not?

123
00:13:08,094 --> 00:13:09,511
你看着像个可信的人
You seem trustworthy

124
00:13:10,511 --> 00:13:12,844
呃 Ruby 那是什么东西?
Uhh, Ruby..! What is that?

125
00:13:13,219 --> 00:13:13,886
呃啊!
Ugh!

126
00:13:15,136 --> 00:13:15,636
Yang…
Yang...

127
00:13:20,094 --> 00:13:22,761
我以为你看到我们会更高兴一些的
I sorta thought you'd be a little happier to see us.

128
00:13:23,719 --> 00:13:25,969
我很高兴只是
I am, it's just..

129
00:13:26,594 --> 00:13:28,636
当时情况应该很不乐观 对吧?
It must have gone pretty bad, huh?

130
00:13:37,428 --> 00:13:38,386
Weiss…
Weiss...

131
00:13:40,344 --> 00:13:42,136
一切都发生得太快了
Everything happened so fast.

132
00:13:42,594 --> 00:13:44,428
没有人从真空王国回来支援
No one came back from Vacuo to help.

133
00:13:45,303 --> 00:13:46,094
还有Penny…
And Penny...

134
00:13:46,886 --> 00:13:50,594
她…Jaune尽力支援了 但她还是牺牲了自己…
She... Jaune tried to help but she's sacrificed herself ...

135
00:13:59,094 --> 00:14:02,178
所以现在 我们不知道圣遗物怎么样了
So, we have no idea what happened to the relic.

136
00:14:03,344 --> 00:14:05,344
也不知道所有在真空的人都怎么样了?
Or what happened to everyone in Vacuo?

137
00:14:06,053 --> 00:14:07,511
也不知道Neo在哪?
Or where Neo is?

138
00:14:08,094 --> 00:14:09,719
或许其他人都成功撤离了
Maybe everyone else made it.

139
00:14:10,011 --> 00:14:12,511
我不知道 但我总有种不好的预感
I don't know, but I have a bad feeling.

140
00:14:12,969 --> 00:14:13,886
Neo也在这里
Neo's here too.

141
00:14:14,636 --> 00:14:16,094
你还好吗?
Hey, are you alright?

142
00:14:17,969 --> 00:14:19,469
她在我们坠落时攻击了我
She attacked me when we were falling.

143
00:14:20,428 --> 00:14:24,886
好了 Ruby的武器还没找到
Okay, Ruby's weapon's still missing,

144
00:14:25,344 --> 00:14:26,511
Yang的手臂也被偷了
Yang's arm was stolen,

145
00:14:27,136 --> 00:14:29,219
我想我们应该先把丟了的东西找回来
I think we'd focus on getting everything back,

146
00:14:29,469 --> 00:14:31,594
然后再想想我们具体应该怎么离开这里
Then we can figure out exactly how to get out of here.

147
00:14:32,344 --> 00:14:34,469
不管‘这里’到底是什么地方…
Where ever here' is..

148
00:14:35,761 --> 00:14:37,928
但是 如果我们走不了呢?
But, what if we can't leave?

149
00:14:38,761 --> 00:14:39,928
或者 如果…
Or, what if...

150
00:14:40,261 --> 00:14:41,178
如果我们已经死了呢?
What if we are dead?

151
00:14:43,219 --> 00:14:46,261
在你们找到我之前 我以为我肯定已经死了
Until you all found me, I thought for sure I was.

152
00:14:46,761 --> 00:14:49,386
不 我不觉得我们死了
No, I don't think we're dead.

153
00:14:51,803 --> 00:14:57,511
我知道这听起来很怪 但是 我觉得我们是在一个童话里
I know how this sounds, but, I think we are in a fairytale.